accept csv only.
\item Single query results show whichever metadata columns the database has.
\code{strprofiler} always shows \code{Center} and \code{Passage}, empty if the database
lacks them.
\item Amelogenin is recognised under any of the spellings in
\code{\link[=amelogeninMarkers]{amelogeninMarkers()}}. \code{strprofiler}'s application only recognises a
marker named \code{Amelogenin}.
